=== ready
Opened side track relay-store (@side-000123), a Work track on api. It reports to you on the relay. It opens its pull request as a draft: when it reports one, check the PR against the task you gave, then mark it ready with `gh pr ready <url>`.

=== drafts kept
Opened side track relay-store (@side-000123), a Work track on api. It reports to you on the relay. It opens its pull request as a draft: when it reports one, check the PR against the task you gave, and leave it a draft: the repo's rule keeps it one for the user.

